/-!
# ABG local theory and recognition ingredients

This assembly re-exports the proved local group theory, characteristic
parameters, and the three main theorem statements. The characteristic-three
recognition route additionally exposes the actual determinant-sign linear
character of GL2(3), for the paired rows in Wong's character table. Its
representation and irreducibility are proved independently of the existing
main-theorem placeholders. Source-specific proof overviews and provenance
are in the owning modules; the final main theorems remain separate goals.
-/
